    <Description>
Adds AMD FRS 2.2.1 in Space Engineers, the highest for DX11.

Optional Anomaly Shader Framework supplies object motion to prevent ghosting.
When Anomaly and Rich HUD Master are loaded, settings also appear under Anomaly Shaders.

Compat: Certain rendering mods may not play nice until they use Anomaly.
    </Description>

    <SourceDirectories>
        <Directory>ClientPlugin</Directory>
    </SourceDirectories>

    <!-- No GitHub Asset until amd_frs.dll is published. Pulsar treats a 404 as
         Network! and refuses to load the plugin. Local -Sources uses Assets/amd_frs.dll
         copied to Pulsar Legacy\Local by Native\build.bat + ClientPlugin deploy. -->

    <Platforms>Windows</Platforms>

    <!-- Do not list Master or Anomaly here. Anomaly is detected at runtime. -->

